      "bullets": [
        "The Intercept closed internal access to Snowden's ~1.7M NSA/GCHQ documents in 2019, leaving most files permanently unanalyzed and unpublished.",
        "Security analysts lose visibility into historical SIGINT capabilities as institutional funding shifts and legal liabilities stall further cataloging efforts.",
        "Remaining materials stay fragmented among original reporting partners, highlighting long-term digital preservation and governance risks for major whistleblower archives."
      ]
